# SynAPS-MobiRoute

cff-version: 1.2.0
title: SynAPS-MobiRoute
message: If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Konkov
    given-names: Dmitrij
    alias: KonkovDV
repository-code: https://github.com/KonkovDV/SynAPS-MobiRoute
url: https://github.com/KonkovDV/SynAPS-MobiRoute
abstract: >-
  Verifiable routing kernel for pickup-and-delivery problems with time windows
  (DARP / PDPTW): Rust insertion heuristics, ALNS, exact CP-SAT and MIP models,
  and an independent difference-constraint notary that returns quantified
  why-not certificates. Reproduces the published optimum of Cordeau (2006)
  a2-16; operator scenarios are synthetic.
keywords:
  - dial-a-ride
  - paratransit
  - accessible transport
  - optimization
  - constraint programming
  - mixed-integer programming
  - vehicle routing
license: MIT
version: 0.3.0
date-released: "2026-11-13"
